{%- comment -%} v84: on the Destiny 2 stats page, a feature grid that shows everything the Bungie API lets players do on RankSurge. Deep links open the planner straight into each tool. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>.d2-feat{margin:4px 0 22px}.d2-feat__h{font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,28px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px;color:#F2F4F8}.d2-feat__p{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:17px;color:#C9CFDA;max-width:760px}
.d2-feat__g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,250px),1fr));gap:12px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.d2-feat__g li{display:flex}.d2-feat__a{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;width:100%;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--bd);border-top:3px solid var(--c,var(--g));background:linear-gradient(160deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c,var(--g)) 14%,var(--sf)),var(--sf) 65%);color:#DCE0E8!important;text-decoration:none!important;transition:transform .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.d2-feat__a:hover,.d2-feat__a:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--c,var(--g));box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.45),0 0 0 1px var(--c,var(--g))}.d2-feat__a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c,var(--g));outline-offset:3px}
.d2-feat__i{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c,var(--g)) 22%,#0B0E14);color:var(--c,var(--g))}.d2-feat__i svg{width:26px;height:26px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.d2-feat__t{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#F2F4F8}.d2-feat__d{font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#C9CFDA}.d2-feat__go{margin-top:auto;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--c,var(--g))}
.d2-feat__new{position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ex);color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.d2-feat__a{transition:none}.d2-feat__a:hover{transform:none}}</style>
<div class="rsd2 d2-feat-wrap" style="padding:0"><div class="rs-wrap"><section class="d2-feat" aria-labelledby="d2-feat-h"><h2 class="d2-feat__h" id="d2-feat-h">Do more with your Guardian</h2><p class="d2-feat__p">Sign in with Bungie once and RankSurge can read your vault and characters, find your best gear and equip it for you. It can only move, equip and save loadouts; it never deletes, dismantles or trades items.</p><ul class="d2-feat__g">
{%- assign f = '#E3C155|destiny-2-build-planner#agent|New|AI loadouts for any activity|Pick a raid, Grandmaster, Trials or Gambit and get 3 loadouts built from your own vault, then equip one on your Guardian in one tap.|Get AI loadouts|<path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/>;#8AB4FF|destiny-2-build-planner#optimize||Best build from my gear|Pick the stats you want, an exotic and a set bonus. RankSurge checks every armor combination you own using your exact rolls.|Find my best build|<circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/>;#00E676|destiny-2-build-planner#compare|New|Compare builds A vs B|Line up two builds stat by stat, with the difference, set bonuses and warnings side by side before you farm.|Compare builds|<rect x="3" y="4" width="7" height="16" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="4" width="7" height="16" rx="1.5"/><path d="M10 12h4"/>;#9B6BD6|destiny-2-build-planner||Save to an in-game loadout|Send any build to a loadout slot. RankSurge moves each item to the right character, equips it and saves the loadout.|Open the build planner|<path d="M12 3v12M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M4 17v3h16v-3"/>;#5FD4C9|destiny-2-vault-manager||Vault manager|Search, filter and move weapons and armor between your vault and characters without loading into the game.|Manage my vault|<rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="15" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12.5" r="3"/><path d="M12 9.5V8M7 20v1.5M17 20v1.5"/>;#FF8A65|destiny-2-weapons||Weapons database|Every weapon with perks, rolls and stats from Bungie’s item data, updated daily after reset.|Browse weapons|<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3"/>;#C9A0FF|destiny-2-armor||Armor database|Archetypes, tertiary stats, set bonuses and exotic perks for every class.|Browse armor|<path d="M5 14a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v3H5z"/><path d="M9 17v3M15 17v3M8 12h8"/>;#FFD54F|destiny-2-best-weapons-and-armor||Best weapons and armor|Community meta picks for PvE and PvP, the newest weapons and the stat leaders in each weapon type.|See the meta|<path d="M8 4h8v5a4 4 0 0 1-8 0z"/><path d="M8 6H5a3 3 0 0 0 3 4M16 6h3a3 3 0 0 1-3 4M12 13v4M8 21h8"/>' | split: ';' -%}
{%- for x in f -%}{%- assign q = x | split: '|' -%}<li><a class="d2-feat__a" style="--c:{{ q[0] }}" href="/pages/{{ q[1] }}">{%- if q[2] != blank -%}<span class="d2-feat__new">{{ q[2] }}</span>{%- endif -%}<span class="d2-feat__i"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">{{ q[6] }}</svg></span><span class="d2-feat__t">{{ q[3] }}</span><span class="d2-feat__d">{{ q[4] }}</span><span class="d2-feat__go">{{ q[5] }} &rarr;</span></a></li>{%- endfor -%}
</ul></section></div></div>
